                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL DE GESTION D'IMAGE, PROCÉDÉ DE COMMANDE ET PROGRAMME</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">IMAGE MANAGEMENT APPARATUS, CONTROL METHOD, AND PROGRAM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An image management apparatus (103) comprises a receiving unit configured to receive a captured image transmitted from an image capturing apparatus (102), a transfer unit (404) configured to transfer the received captured image to an external storage service (104), an output unit (405) configured to output information which is used for displaying a transfer setting screen (501) on a user device, wherein the transfer setting screen (501) includes a plurality of permission levels and a name indicating the external storage service, and a management unit (403) configured to manage transfer setting information in which the external storage service and a setting value indicating a permission level which is used for disclosing the received captured image at the permission level are associated based on information which is sent from the user device, wherein the transfer unit (404) transfers information indicating the permission level to the external storage service based on the transfer setting information.</p>
            </abstract>
